{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52795","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 韩倩","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子綦南国隐，周氏北山居。\n羽客轻簪绶，霓裳下里闾。\n仙帆归海近，云气度关虚。\n今日辞明主，深恩宠汉疏。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩倩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}